@format 1
@id queue.load
@title Load schedule
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary Reconcile the persistent depot and index into the observable worklist.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.recover-stale
@tag queue
@tag load
@tag index

@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Schedule load requested <input>
- Begin a schedule refresh after startup or a durable state transition @ schedule.LScheduleLoad(...)
> index

[index] Prepare index <decision>
- Create the depot index and recover stale claims @ schedule.LScheduleLoad(...)
- Rebuild the index when it is dirty @ schedule.LScheduleLoad(...)
? "Index is usable" > read-index
? "Index remains dirty" > read-folders

[read-index] Read indexed records <process>
- Parse records exposed by the depot index @ schedule.LScheduleIndexRead(...)
> rebuild

[read-folders] Scan depot folders <process>
- Read records directly from every schedule-state folder @ schedule.LScheduleFolderRead(...)
> rebuild

[rebuild] Rebuild observable schedule <output>
- Preserve live running objects and recreate other work items @ schedule.LScheduleItemsBuild(...)
- Sort work by creation time and notify observers @ schedule.LScheduleItemsBuild(...)
= The worklist reflects durable schedule state.
